  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "こうげきした　あいてを\nやけど　じょうたいに　することが　ある。\nきゅうしょにも　あたりやすい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "공격한 상대를\n화상 상태로 만들 때가 있다.\n급소에도 맞기 쉽다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "有時會讓受到攻擊的對手\n陷入灼傷狀態。\n且容易擊中要害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Le lanceur envoie un coup de pied au taux de critiques\nélevé. Peut aussi brûler la cible.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Starker Tritt mit hoher Volltrefferquote. Verursacht\neventuell Verbrennungen.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Patada que suele ser un golpe crítico y puede causar\nquemaduras.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Chi la usa tira un calcio. Probabile brutto colpo.\nPuò anche scottare il bersaglio.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The user launches a kick that lands a critical hit\nmore easily. This may also leave the target with\na burn.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "攻撃した　相手を\nやけど状態に　することが　ある。\n急所にも　当たりやすい。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "攻击对手后，\n有时会使其陷入灼伤状态。\n也容易击中要害。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Patada que suele ser un golpe crítico y puede causar\nquemaduras.",
      "version_group": {
